Chapter: PeReturnArm

 The payload build/boot/pe-return-arm.ps1 boots under OVMF: it starts the timer
 through runtime-init, prints its marker and returns to the PE stub's epilog.

 We say:

Section: Main

  opening : [Console, Device.Port] Nothing = act
    ri <- runtime-init 0
    print-line-uni "pe-return-arm-end"
  end
